From: Aditya Teltia <teltia.aditya22@gmail.com>
Subject: avcodec/avformat: AV2 decoder and low-overhead OBU input

Backported from https://code.ffmpeg.org/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/pulls/23018.
Downstream changes add AV02 IVF, multi-picture record timestamps, accurate
IVF seeking and an explicit private codec ID shared by both FFmpeg pins.

